["- z financial assets measured at amortized cost: as a deduction from the gross carrying amount of the assets;
- z where a financial instrument includes both a drawn and an undrawn component, and the Group cannot identify the ECL on the financing commitment component separately from those on the drawn component: the Group presents a combined loss allowance for both components. The combined amount is presented as a deduction from the gross carrying amount of the drawn component. Any excess of the loss allowance over the gross amount of the drawn component is presented as a provision; and
- z financing commitments and financial guarantee contracts: generally, as a provision;
- z debt instruments measured at FVOCI: no loss allowance is recognized in the statement of financial position because the carrying amount of these assets is their fair value. However, the loss allowance is disclosed and is recognized in the fair value reserve.", "FVOCI debt instruments are subsequently measured at fair value with gains and losses arising due to changes in fair value recognized in OCI. Profit income and foreign exchange gains and losses are recognized in consolidated statement of income.", "Balance at 31 December 2022,  = . Balance at 31 December 2022, Share capital = 40,000,000. Balance at 31 December 2022, Statutory reserve = 29,287,706. Net income for the year,  = . Net income for the year, Share capital = -. Net income for the year, Statutory reserve = -. Net change in fair value of FVOCI Equity investments,  = 20. Net change in fair value of FVOCI Equity investments, Share capital = -. Net change in fair value of FVOCI Equity investments, Statutory reserve = -. Net change in fair value of FVOCI Sukuk investments and Structured products investments,  = 20. Net change in fair value of FVOCI Sukuk investments and Structured products investments, Share capital = -. Net change in fair value of FVOCI Sukuk investments and Structured products investments, Statutory reserve = -. Share in FVOCI from associates,  = 20. Share in FVOCI from associates, Share capital = -. Share in FVOCI from associates, Statutory reserve = -. Actuarial gain on re-measurement of employees' 'EOSB',  = 20. Actuarial gain on re-measurement of employees' 'EOSB', Share capital = -. Actuarial gain on re-measurement of employees' 'EOSB', Statutory reserve = -. Exchange difference on translation of foreign operations,  = 20. Exchange difference on translation of foreign operations, Share capital = -. Exchange difference on translation of foreign operations, Statutory reserve = -. Cash flow hedge effective portion of change in the fair value,  = 20. Cash flow hedge effective portion 